Next, you should shut down the computer, remove the installation medium and turn
the system back on. After entering your encryption password, you should be taken
to the tty login screen where you can login as root. Once logged in as root, run
strapping-young-lad/syl.sh 9 to continue the setup.

If you wish to set up Secure Boot later on, you can also enter Secure Boot setup
mode before booting into the system. However, you may also do this at a later
stage of the installation process.